    "body": "The following data fields should not be reported in Telemetry without explicit enabling by the developer\r\n\r\n|Property|`EventString`|Notes|\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n|Subject|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|UPN|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|Given Name|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|Family Name|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|Email|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|OID|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|Login Hint|`LOGIN_HINT`|   |\r\n|Home OID|   |Not tracked by telemetry|\r\n|Exception traces containing network responses|   |    |\r\n|AT/RT/IdToken|`USER_ID`|   |\r\n|Tenant Id|`TENANT_ID`|   |",
